WEBVTT

00:13.722 --> 00:14.973
Akine Atagawa.

00:16.474 --> 00:17.308
Please.

00:18.893 --> 00:20.395
I would like us to be friends.

00:21.896 --> 00:22.939
Manatsu Atagawa's...

00:24.107 --> 00:25.275
little sister?

01:57.909 --> 02:01.663
Inversion

02:02.664 --> 02:03.706
Manatsu Atagawa!

02:04.249 --> 02:05.750
I've played ball for years.

02:05.834 --> 02:07.460
It's nice to meet all of you.

02:08.253 --> 02:09.754
- Welcome to the club.
- Nice to meet you.

02:09.838 --> 02:12.632
- How are ya doing!
- During my first year of junior high

02:13.133 --> 02:15.301
Sachi, my neighbor at the time invited me

02:15.802 --> 02:17.512
to join the basketball team.

02:17.595 --> 02:18.680
Koyuki!

02:19.430 --> 02:20.807
I'm so glad you signed up!

02:21.391 --> 02:22.976
Sorry, I'm no Miki, but-

02:23.059 --> 02:25.770
Hey, I'm happy you joined us even if Miki
couldn't.

02:26.396 --> 02:27.355
Volleyball CHOP!

02:27.438 --> 02:28.356
*MIKI JOINED THE VOLLEYBALL CLUB

02:28.439 --> 02:31.526
- Is this your friend, Sachi?
- I think we'll make a good team.

02:31.609 --> 02:33.945
- It's nice to meet you all.
- Nice to meet you!

02:34.028 --> 02:36.197
- Glad to have you.
- The upperclassmen were so nice to me.

02:36.281 --> 02:37.115
GRADE 3 CLASS 1

02:37.198 --> 02:38.032
Here you go.

02:38.116 --> 02:40.702
The second and third years'll practice on
the court.

02:40.785 --> 02:43.371
The first years will practice something
else today.

02:43.454 --> 02:44.289
Okay.

02:44.873 --> 02:47.250
It was reassuring to have someone I knew
there.

02:47.792 --> 02:48.877
Tell all the others!

02:51.838 --> 02:52.672
Hey Koyuki.

02:53.631 --> 02:54.632
Come again, okay?

02:56.593 --> 02:58.011
She's so cuuuute!

02:58.094 --> 02:59.012
Leave her alone!

02:59.512 --> 03:01.264
That's why I didn't notice it sooner.

03:01.347 --> 03:02.473
You guys are so lame.

03:02.557 --> 03:04.851
- Why're we lame?
- She clearly didn't like it.

03:04.934 --> 03:06.186
What was all that?

03:06.811 --> 03:07.687
GIRLS' BASKETBALL CLUB

03:07.770 --> 03:09.647
The first years will be practicing
outside today.

03:09.731 --> 03:10.565
Hm?

03:10.648 --> 03:13.026
Captain gave me this practice program to
follow.

03:13.109 --> 03:14.110
What is this?

03:14.194 --> 03:15.111
Huh?

03:15.195 --> 03:16.029
ATAGAWA

03:16.112 --> 03:18.114
Why're you acting like you're in charge?

03:19.574 --> 03:22.702
At first, I just thought the issue was
that she didn't like being told

03:22.785 --> 03:23.620
what to do.

03:24.829 --> 03:25.663
But

03:25.747 --> 03:26.581
CHATTER CHATTER

03:26.664 --> 03:28.666
I wonder if we can make her grow any
taller.

03:28.750 --> 03:30.335
- Hey, you're just stretching her neck.
- Mm?

03:30.418 --> 03:33.213
- Hey every little bit helps in basketball,
- I realized she didn't like me

03:33.296 --> 03:34.130
- right?
- because of how close I was to the

03:34.214 --> 03:35.048
upperclassmen.

03:36.674 --> 03:37.508
Hmm

03:38.635 --> 03:41.763
I get from Manatsu's point of view,
my closeness to Sachi looks like I'm

03:41.846 --> 03:42.931
maybe sucking up, but-

03:43.014 --> 03:44.265
CHILDHOOD FRIENDS CLOSE FRIENDS

03:44.349 --> 03:46.226
I'M MORE SKILLED THAN HER RESENTMENT
I'M MORE SKILLED THAN HER RESENTMENT

03:46.309 --> 03:47.143
Huh?

03:48.144 --> 03:48.978
Atagawa!

03:50.188 --> 03:52.690
The captain asked me to come see
her during lunch. Do ya wanna come

03:52.774 --> 03:53.608
with me?

03:54.234 --> 03:55.068
Huh?

03:56.819 --> 03:57.654
Thank you.

03:57.737 --> 04:01.366
I didn't feel comfortable going to the
third-years' classroom on my own.

04:03.368 --> 04:06.162
I don't get it. Why did the captain
make you her go-to?

04:06.246 --> 04:07.830
We already knew each other.

04:08.373 --> 04:11.209
We live close to each other so she
probably just feels comfortable

04:11.292 --> 04:12.126
talking to me.

04:13.253 --> 04:16.506
I think you're the one on the team she
has the highest hopes for.

04:17.465 --> 04:18.299
Yeah?

04:19.175 --> 04:20.051
GRADE 3 CLASS 1

04:20.134 --> 04:22.095
Oh! You came too, Manatsu.

04:22.178 --> 04:23.137
That's awesome.

04:23.221 --> 04:24.180
Huh?

04:24.264 --> 04:25.098
- Hm?
- Huh?

04:25.181 --> 04:27.517
- Is she your friend, Koyuki?
- Leave em alone, would you?

04:27.600 --> 04:28.726
Uh. Yeah. I'm Manatsu.

04:30.728 --> 04:32.146
So apparently we're friends.

04:33.064 --> 04:34.065
I mean it, Koyuki.

04:34.565 --> 04:36.359
You're like, such an awesome friend.

04:36.442 --> 04:38.361
I had the wrong idea about you.

04:38.444 --> 04:39.279
R-Really?

04:39.362 --> 04:40.363
I'M HAPPY TO HEAR THAT, BUT...

04:40.446 --> 04:42.907
- Why the sudden change of heart?
- Oh, by the way.

04:42.991 --> 04:44.242
Just call me Manatsu.

04:45.535 --> 04:47.120
Being on Manatsu's good side

04:47.203 --> 04:49.122
made club activities a lot easier.

04:49.205 --> 04:50.623
Don't worry. Don't worry.

04:51.332 --> 04:53.084
Whenever Manatsu was with me, she got a

04:53.167 --> 04:56.296
- chance to talk to the upperclassmen.
- Hey, what'd ya buy for lunch?

04:56.379 --> 04:58.339
- Oh my gosh hi!
- Our friendship

04:58.423 --> 05:00.842
was based only on benefits, not trust.

05:02.302 --> 05:03.136
So

05:03.219 --> 05:06.973
it wasn't like there was one decisive
event that caused things to break down.

05:07.056 --> 05:10.560
Speaking of people in our grade,
aren't Hotani and Igarashi super cute?

05:10.643 --> 05:11.477
Oh, totally.

05:11.561 --> 05:12.562
- Wait, what?
- Right?

05:13.062 --> 05:13.896
Hey, Koyuki.

05:15.398 --> 05:17.150
What kinda guys're you into?

05:17.233 --> 05:19.444
I can't picture what your type is at all.

05:19.527 --> 05:21.487
Huh? Mm

05:21.571 --> 05:23.406
Someone who doesn't make fun of other
people?

05:23.489 --> 05:26.075
We're just talking about looks here.
Stay on topic.

05:27.035 --> 05:28.536
Huh? Oh, gotcha.

05:29.370 --> 05:30.204
Hmm...

05:30.830 --> 05:32.915
- I'm not sure.
- Okay.

05:33.666 --> 05:36.294
AWKWARD SILENCE

05:36.794 --> 05:37.795
Nice work out there.

05:37.879 --> 05:39.005
- See you later.
- Later.

05:39.088 --> 05:39.964
See ya.

05:43.259 --> 05:45.178
Is it just me or is Koyuki just-

05:45.845 --> 05:47.513
not on the same wavelength as us?

05:48.139 --> 05:49.640
No, I totally feel you.

05:49.724 --> 05:50.850
She's kinda gloomy.

05:50.933 --> 05:51.893
She is!

05:51.976 --> 05:55.104
She talks so freaking slow, and I
kinda got annoyed just then. Could

05:55.188 --> 05:57.440
you tell? I was like, hurry up and answer.

05:57.982 --> 06:00.193
- Of course I could tell.
- Honestly, we hadn't really built

06:00.276 --> 06:01.736
- You were so obvious Manatsu.
- anything to begin with.

06:01.819 --> 06:03.529
Koyuki, you're such a good friend.

06:05.198 --> 06:07.658
Manatsu never liked me for who I was.

06:08.576 --> 06:10.745
She just liked what I could do for her.

06:12.705 --> 06:14.207
You like doing grunt work?

06:14.749 --> 06:17.335
Don't you have anything else going on
in your life?

06:19.128 --> 06:20.296
She's eating all alone.

06:20.797 --> 06:23.257
Ew, her water bottle is so lame,
isn't it?

06:23.883 --> 06:25.051
- Oh, that's insane.
- So

06:25.134 --> 06:27.762
- Right? Are you serious?
- it didn't take much for me to be branded

06:27.845 --> 06:29.847
- as a villain.
- Like what's her problem?

06:31.307 --> 06:33.768
I can't take it anymore. I'm quitting.

06:34.852 --> 06:36.479
I should have quit then and there.

06:36.562 --> 06:39.565
And cut ties with her completely,
gotten her out of my life.

06:39.649 --> 06:40.483
CLUB WITHDRAWAL FORM

06:40.566 --> 06:45.238
So you know... Atagawa's been coming
on to me super strong lately.

06:45.780 --> 06:46.614
Huh?

06:47.365 --> 06:50.868
Although... I'm not into in anyone but
the girl I like... She's barking up

06:50.952 --> 06:52.245
the wrong tree.

06:54.247 --> 06:56.582
Manatsu... likes Igarashi?

06:59.085 --> 07:00.545
Do you get what I'm saying?

07:00.628 --> 07:01.671
Mm?

07:04.215 --> 07:06.259
Let's go out. Koyuki.

07:07.218 --> 07:10.263
Honestly
the very first thing I thought was

07:10.805 --> 07:12.473
Wow, at least he finally said it.

07:13.391 --> 07:15.601
And also "I wish he'd let go of my hand,"

07:16.894 --> 07:20.606
and, "He doesn't seem to think there's
any chance that I'll reject him."

07:20.690 --> 07:22.442
And also, "I don't understand why in the

07:22.525 --> 07:24.068
- world he even started liking me
- Koyuki.

07:24.152 --> 07:25.153
In the first place."

07:25.736 --> 07:27.447
- All at once.
- Koyuki.

07:28.948 --> 07:30.825
Just cutting her out of my life

07:30.908 --> 07:32.994
wouldn't be enough to satiate my anger.

07:34.203 --> 07:36.164
- That's why.
- Sure.

07:36.789 --> 07:40.501
I was more than well aware of all the
red flags my heart was waving at me.

07:41.586 --> 07:42.420
Why not.

07:43.087 --> 07:43.921
But I just

07:44.547 --> 07:46.090
pretended not to notice.

07:47.467 --> 07:48.384
This again.

07:49.427 --> 07:52.013
After I quit the club and started dating
Igarashi

07:52.096 --> 07:54.974
her bullying became way less direct
and obvious.

07:55.475 --> 07:57.477
And more subtle and underhanded.

07:57.560 --> 07:58.519
Yo!

07:58.603 --> 08:02.690
Probably because she didn't want me to go
to Igarashi or the other guys about it.

08:02.773 --> 08:03.816
Besides

08:04.317 --> 08:06.611
I needed proof Manatsu was the one
behind it.

08:06.694 --> 08:08.112
Good morning, Koyun!

08:08.821 --> 08:11.782
I got here with time to spare which
never happens, so...

08:12.450 --> 08:13.284
Huh?

08:16.412 --> 08:18.039
A-ta-ga-waaa!

08:19.290 --> 08:20.124
Get off me!

08:26.923 --> 08:28.132
She shattered the glass!

08:28.633 --> 08:30.968
Oh my gosh Miki! Let's go to the nurse!

08:31.052 --> 08:31.886
Huh?

08:31.969 --> 08:33.804
- Hey- Whoaaaa!
- Whoa, was that blood?

08:33.888 --> 08:35.097
Did they fight?

08:40.102 --> 08:40.937
Are you serious?

08:41.437 --> 08:44.065
You rely on the guys and now Miki
to fight for you?

08:44.774 --> 08:47.652
How are you not ashamed of always
playing the victim and leeching off

08:47.735 --> 08:50.363
everyone around you? It's pathetic.

08:51.781 --> 08:52.615
Because

08:53.407 --> 08:56.077
compared to someone who stoops to
childish bullying

08:56.160 --> 08:57.828
I have nothing to be ashamed of.

08:59.080 --> 09:01.040
I already said I didn't do it, alright?

09:01.624 --> 09:03.209
Who else would do it but you?

09:03.292 --> 09:04.418
Could be anyone.

09:04.919 --> 09:06.837
Everyone passes the shoe lockers.

09:06.921 --> 09:08.005
Idiot.

09:09.924 --> 09:10.883
I never said that.

09:11.759 --> 09:12.593
Huh?

09:12.677 --> 09:14.887
I never said anything about the
shoe lockers.

09:14.971 --> 09:16.681
You were the one who mentioned it.

09:18.140 --> 09:20.351
Hey, over here! This way, guys.

09:20.434 --> 09:21.394
In here.

09:22.770 --> 09:24.772
You did this to yourself.

09:24.855 --> 09:27.066
- Come on.
- Are you nuts?

09:27.692 --> 09:28.526
Come on.

09:29.860 --> 09:30.695
Hey!

09:30.778 --> 09:34.156
First you abandon the club then you get
everyone to take your side.

09:34.740 --> 09:37.910
You're just a sad pathetic loner
who can't do anything herself.

09:38.494 --> 09:39.745
Stay just like that.

09:39.829 --> 09:40.788
Why are you grinning?!

09:40.871 --> 09:41.831
What are you doing?

09:43.499 --> 09:45.251
- Igarashi.
- Hey.

09:45.334 --> 09:47.545
Hey. Hey, hey, hey, hey, hey, hey.

09:48.713 --> 09:51.382
What are you- What are you doing, Atagawa?

09:52.216 --> 09:53.342
Are you okay, Koyuki?

09:56.220 --> 09:57.054
That hurt.

10:02.184 --> 10:03.853
That was sick, Igarashi!

10:03.936 --> 10:04.937
Whoo!

10:05.021 --> 10:05.938
You're the man!

10:06.022 --> 10:07.023
Hmph

10:07.565 --> 10:09.275
You're really lucky, Koyuki.

10:09.358 --> 10:10.610
You can cry so well.

10:10.693 --> 10:12.320
A delicate little flower.

10:12.403 --> 10:13.654
And so cute.

10:14.864 --> 10:17.366
You may have a man fighting your battles
right now.

10:17.450 --> 10:19.160
But don't get carried away.

10:20.411 --> 10:21.245
That's enough!

10:22.121 --> 10:23.497
What'd you just say to her?

10:24.415 --> 10:25.291
Let's go, Koyuki!

10:28.961 --> 10:30.212
Manatsu Atagawa

10:31.797 --> 10:33.341
And her little sister, Akine.

10:34.592 --> 10:35.885
What exactly and how much

10:36.385 --> 10:37.803
does she know about me?

10:40.306 --> 10:42.016
Ugh, I hate this so much!

10:42.099 --> 10:45.478
I'm getting sucked back into the
toxicity of junior high that I hated so

10:45.561 --> 10:46.395
much

10:46.479 --> 10:49.940
Not just that. I hate the person
I was back then. Ugh, I hate it all!

10:55.196 --> 10:57.323
Miki You're on social media now?

10:57.823 --> 11:00.493
Yeah, Miharu and Sora recommended
this app.

11:00.576 --> 11:02.578
MIHARU, SORA FRIENDS FROM JUNIOR HIGH

11:02.662 --> 11:05.665
Oh! Found it!
This is Manatsu's younger sister.

11:06.165 --> 11:07.041
#SISTERS #BESTIES

11:07.124 --> 11:08.167
#Besties.

11:10.044 --> 11:10.878
What's up?

11:11.462 --> 11:13.130
What're you guys doing over here?

11:14.548 --> 11:16.342
Huh? Atagawa?

11:16.967 --> 11:19.345
We're in the same class. We talk all the
time.

11:19.845 --> 11:23.307
Yeah, Akine said she hears a lot about
me from you actually.

11:24.392 --> 11:25.810
So, what have you told her?

11:26.310 --> 11:27.395
Well,

11:27.478 --> 11:30.272
just that we've been close friends
for a long time.

11:30.356 --> 11:34.026
Koyun, if you marry me, you and Miki will
be related. Isn't that so cute?

11:34.110 --> 11:36.278
- You're a genius.
- Yeah sure, whatever.

11:37.029 --> 11:39.156
I also told her you and I might get
married.

11:39.240 --> 11:41.617
- One day.
- Why'd you tell her that?

11:42.493 --> 11:44.370
Well anyway

11:44.995 --> 11:47.498
DUH-HUH!

11:47.581 --> 11:48.416
All that to say, I have no idea what

11:48.499 --> 11:49.333
She always acts cool and aloof.

11:49.417 --> 11:51.210
She's thinking, to be honest.

11:51.293 --> 11:52.920
She's not a bad person, I think.

11:53.003 --> 11:54.463
Probably. Maybe.

11:55.297 --> 11:56.882
That's what Yuki said.

11:57.883 --> 12:01.595
But I still have no idea how much or what
she actually knows about me.

12:01.679 --> 12:06.100
I hate the fact someone might know things
about me I don't want anyone to know.

12:06.183 --> 12:09.228
Just that thought makes me me so
incredibly uncomfortable.

12:09.979 --> 12:10.855
Please.

12:11.522 --> 12:13.899
I hope I don't have to see much of
her anymore.

12:32.251 --> 12:35.171
Well duh... We live in the same
neighborhood so of course we could run

12:35.254 --> 12:37.131
into each other on the way to school.

12:38.007 --> 12:38.841
So do-

12:38.924 --> 12:42.470
Do first years not participate in the
soccer club's morning practice or

12:42.553 --> 12:45.014
- something?
- There's no practice this morning.

12:45.973 --> 12:47.224
Oh... I see.

12:48.934 --> 12:50.352
SILENCE

12:50.436 --> 12:51.270
This is awkward.

12:52.229 --> 12:53.189
In moments like this

12:53.272 --> 12:56.275
the older one is supposed to start the
conversation, right?

12:56.358 --> 12:58.152
But what should I talk about?

12:59.820 --> 13:01.071
What do we have in common?

13:01.155 --> 13:01.989
Anything?

13:02.072 --> 13:04.575
I really don't wanna talk about
junior high school.

13:04.658 --> 13:05.743
Maybe high school?

13:05.826 --> 13:07.787
Ugh who wants to talk about school?

13:09.497 --> 13:11.999
What should I do? I'm so bad at talking.

13:16.545 --> 13:17.379
Good morning.

13:19.215 --> 13:20.132
Hey, Amamiya.

13:24.220 --> 13:25.054
What was that reaction?

13:25.137 --> 13:25.971
THUMP THUMP THUMP THUMP THUMP THUMP

13:26.055 --> 13:29.016
Thank goodness.

13:29.099 --> 13:29.934
I'll be okay now.

13:30.017 --> 13:30.851
Hi Amamiya...

13:30.935 --> 13:31.769
Huh?

13:31.852 --> 13:32.770
- Good to see you.
- Did you two come together?

13:32.853 --> 13:34.522
Ran into each other on the train.

13:37.191 --> 13:38.025
Wow!

13:38.651 --> 13:39.985
You like that song too?

13:40.069 --> 13:41.445
I play it on repeat.

13:42.321 --> 13:43.155
Wow...

13:43.239 --> 13:45.616
He's so good at keeping the conversation
going.

13:46.450 --> 13:47.284
Amamiya

13:47.868 --> 13:51.747
I'm sorry for thinking you asked way too
many questions or found it exhausting.

13:51.831 --> 13:55.376
And I'm also sorry for laughing
at you when you were totally losing it.

13:55.459 --> 13:56.544
Stare.

13:57.294 --> 13:59.129
W-What? Something on my face?

14:00.005 --> 14:00.840
No

14:00.923 --> 14:04.552
MMPH MMPH

14:04.635 --> 14:05.469
I just feel

14:05.553 --> 14:09.473
kinda bad for teasing you back when you
were freaking out during spring break.

14:09.557 --> 14:10.391
Wait, why now?

14:14.812 --> 14:16.522
- Oh I'm getting it.
- Mmm

14:16.605 --> 14:17.439
Right here.

14:17.523 --> 14:18.357
- Force field.
- C'mon.

14:18.440 --> 14:19.358
You two're close, huh?

14:19.441 --> 14:21.360
Not really. I'm being bullied by her.

14:21.861 --> 14:23.070
She's blackmailing me.

14:23.571 --> 14:24.738
Huh? Hold on a minute.

14:31.495 --> 14:32.746
Hey, good morning, Akine!

14:33.372 --> 14:34.206
Momoka.

14:34.290 --> 14:36.917
I happened to see you and just ran
right over here.

14:37.001 --> 14:38.043
Wow

14:38.127 --> 14:39.962
she looks like a doll or something.

14:40.045 --> 14:41.171
Oh hi, Amamiya.

14:41.672 --> 14:42.923
Good morning to you too.

14:43.757 --> 14:44.592
Kuriki, right?

14:45.342 --> 14:47.553
You came to check out our club the
other day.

14:47.636 --> 14:49.513
Oh my goodness, you remember me?

14:50.389 --> 14:53.392
I ended up ultimately choosing not
to join a club after all

14:53.475 --> 14:55.185
so I haven't been back since.

14:55.686 --> 14:57.646
Aha, don't even worry about it.

14:57.730 --> 14:59.106
Plus, Atagawa's joining us.

14:59.857 --> 15:01.191
Oh I'm not that great-

15:01.275 --> 15:03.485
Akine seems like she'd be really
good at it.

15:04.028 --> 15:05.779
- It's like she glows.
- Hm?

15:06.780 --> 15:07.615
Oh.

15:09.867 --> 15:11.285
Oh... I get it.

15:12.077 --> 15:13.537
I think I'm not welcome here.

15:13.621 --> 15:14.663
That's it.

15:15.581 --> 15:17.458
I guess I'll just head to class then.

15:21.420 --> 15:22.254
What is he-

15:25.716 --> 15:26.800
Well then, Amamiya

15:26.884 --> 15:28.010
See you around.

15:28.636 --> 15:30.012
See you at the cheer squad.

15:34.934 --> 15:36.894
- What was that?
- I dunno...

15:36.977 --> 15:40.064
just thought you might be trying to
quietly float away again.

15:42.524 --> 15:44.485
- You got me.
- It was obvious.

15:47.613 --> 15:48.656
WHOOSH WHOOSH

15:48.739 --> 15:52.326
- I feel like a dog being taken for a walk.
- Wanna run in the park?

15:52.409 --> 15:53.243
What is this?

15:53.327 --> 15:54.203
PONTA

15:54.286 --> 15:55.120
No thank you.

15:56.997 --> 15:58.040
I'm over the moon.

15:58.123 --> 16:00.501
I didn't think Amamiya would remember me!

16:01.418 --> 16:04.046
Momoka. You've only met this guy one time.

16:04.630 --> 16:06.340
Correction: I met him two times!

16:07.007 --> 16:07.841
Okay.

16:09.051 --> 16:10.594
Hey Akine...

16:11.553 --> 16:12.846
Do you think that Amamiya

16:12.930 --> 16:14.264
might have a girlfriend?

16:16.141 --> 16:17.851
CHATTER CHATTER

16:18.352 --> 16:20.145
Hmm... I don't know.

16:20.938 --> 16:22.147
Can you find out for me?

16:26.568 --> 16:28.696
So how's your new class?

16:31.740 --> 16:35.577
You keep staring at me with this weird
grin and it's making me uncomfortable.

16:35.661 --> 16:37.413
IRREGULARLY HELD DINNER MEETING

16:37.496 --> 16:40.541
Oh what a delight. I'm ever so
happy to see you happy.

16:41.291 --> 16:43.210
Yeah whatever that is, knock it off.

16:45.379 --> 16:48.257
I didn't think I'd ever be fussing over
people this much.

16:48.882 --> 16:50.718
So, anything going on with you?

16:50.801 --> 16:51.844
Huh?

16:52.344 --> 16:53.178
No. Nothing.

16:53.262 --> 16:54.096
HMPH

16:54.722 --> 16:55.764
Okay, sorry I asked.

16:56.515 --> 16:58.726
To be honest with you, back in
junior high

16:58.809 --> 17:00.728
I only dated this one guy.

17:02.062 --> 17:04.314
I tried to get to know him little by
little.

17:05.566 --> 17:09.028
I dated him, thinking I'd eventually fall
in love with him over time.

17:09.903 --> 17:11.321
But that didn't go too well.

17:12.614 --> 17:13.449
I realized

17:13.532 --> 17:16.410
you can't fall in love by forcing
yourself to like someone.

17:16.493 --> 17:17.327
It won't work.

17:17.411 --> 17:18.245
IMPURE MOTIVE

17:19.538 --> 17:21.790
And that wasn't the only reason
I dated him.

17:21.874 --> 17:24.001
I'M SURE

17:24.084 --> 17:26.670
- C'mon don't ask me that.
- But you're different aren't you?

17:26.754 --> 17:29.089
There's a lot of different kinds of
love in the world.

17:29.173 --> 17:30.257
DIFFERENT KINDS

17:30.340 --> 17:32.176
If the type or the sizes don't match

17:32.843 --> 17:34.803
one of the people is going to struggle.

17:35.429 --> 17:37.431
It's not enough to just be liked

17:37.514 --> 17:38.891
or to give love one-sidedly

17:38.974 --> 17:39.975
I'M THE ONLY ONE STRUGGLING

17:40.059 --> 17:40.893
Love is hard.

17:41.643 --> 17:42.978
I feel like I'm still so far

17:43.062 --> 17:44.521
from understanding it.

17:44.605 --> 17:46.231
CREEP CREEP

17:46.315 --> 17:48.484
CURRENT SITUATION

17:48.567 --> 17:50.903
- Don't tell me that. Oh nooo
- Oh.

17:51.570 --> 17:52.404
Get outta here!

17:55.741 --> 17:56.742
I'm sorry.

18:01.580 --> 18:03.874
- I didn't mean it like that.
- How about gyoza?

18:03.957 --> 18:07.377
- No, that stuff makes your breath stink.
- Oh. They're from our school.

18:07.461 --> 18:08.462
Mm?

18:08.545 --> 18:10.380
HURRIEDLY

18:12.716 --> 18:13.592
Upperclassmen.

18:13.675 --> 18:14.760
This is awkward.

18:15.344 --> 18:17.429
A gyoza date's kinda low-key cool, though.

18:17.513 --> 18:18.972
Wait, that girl...

18:23.685 --> 18:25.020
Sorry if my breath stinks.

18:25.104 --> 18:27.272
My breath smells the same, so I
can't tell.

18:35.364 --> 18:36.198
Oh.

18:41.036 --> 18:41.954
Good morning.

18:43.288 --> 18:44.206
You... scared me.

18:44.706 --> 18:47.042
Reading a book while walking?
That's not safe.

18:48.252 --> 18:50.045
- Tch.
- Don't "tch" me.

18:51.171 --> 18:52.297
What were you reading?

18:53.674 --> 18:54.508
Um, I-

18:55.342 --> 18:56.885
What's that? It looks boring.

18:56.969 --> 18:59.012
THE NERVOUSNESS OF TALKING ABOUT
SOMETHING I LIKE Oh

18:59.096 --> 18:59.930
Huh?

19:00.597 --> 19:02.850
I haven't read it, but I did watch the
movie.

19:03.350 --> 19:04.393
It was interesting.

19:05.060 --> 19:05.936
SOFTEN

19:06.979 --> 19:10.065
Another movie based on their books will
be streaming this week.

19:10.149 --> 19:12.401
Oh I watched that in the theater.

19:12.901 --> 19:14.695
I really liked the original novel so

19:14.778 --> 19:18.115
of course I was super excited to see it
adapted for the screen.

19:18.198 --> 19:20.576
Oh... Well, she's in a good mood.

19:21.201 --> 19:23.787
Well if you thought it was good,
I'll check it out.

19:25.414 --> 19:26.331
She looks happy.

19:29.835 --> 19:30.794
She's so cute.

19:31.587 --> 19:32.421
Oh

19:32.504 --> 19:34.840
But I'm sorry in advance if you end up
not liking it.

19:34.923 --> 19:36.049
Woah, why so negative?

19:36.133 --> 19:37.426
I MAY HAVE SET THE BAR TOO HIGH

19:37.509 --> 19:38.343
It'll be fine.

19:45.225 --> 19:46.476
Oh, so we meet again!

19:46.560 --> 19:47.728
Morning, Amamiya!

19:48.478 --> 19:50.439
Oh, Kuriki. Good morning.

19:50.522 --> 19:53.567
Hey, are you going to the cheer squad's
morning practice too?

19:53.650 --> 19:55.402
Mm-mm. I have club practice.

19:56.320 --> 19:57.905
But you'll be there, right Koyun?

19:57.988 --> 19:58.947
Oh.

19:59.031 --> 19:59.865
Yeah.

20:00.532 --> 20:01.867
He calls her... Koyun?

20:04.328 --> 20:05.162
Hello.

20:06.496 --> 20:08.373
THE CONVERSATION ISN'T GOING ANYWHERE

20:10.500 --> 20:11.543
Madam Koyun?

20:12.044 --> 20:13.420
What a weird nickname.

20:13.503 --> 20:14.880
We met yesterday, right?

20:15.505 --> 20:17.007
In front of the restaurant.

20:17.090 --> 20:18.800
Uh Right.

20:18.884 --> 20:20.761
I didn't think she recognized me.

20:21.553 --> 20:23.639
That really tall guy I saw you out with

20:23.722 --> 20:24.806
Is he your boyfriend?

20:26.516 --> 20:28.143
What- No- He's just a friend!

20:28.227 --> 20:29.186
Oh

20:29.269 --> 20:32.606
You guys looked so good together that I
thought you were a couple.

20:33.398 --> 20:36.276
Though I don't remember what he
looked like to be honest.

20:36.360 --> 20:37.361
No way.

20:37.444 --> 20:39.571
Is that what we look like to other
people?

20:39.655 --> 20:41.657
This misunderstanding's a problem.

20:41.740 --> 20:42.699
Yay!

20:43.575 --> 20:44.409
Um...

20:44.493 --> 20:46.328
we're really not like that, okay?

20:46.411 --> 20:48.622
We're just good friends. That's all
we are.

20:48.705 --> 20:50.791
Oh gotcha. Well that's still really nice.

20:51.291 --> 20:52.292
So then

20:52.376 --> 20:54.211
Do you guys go out to eat together?

20:54.294 --> 20:55.504
Just the two of you?

20:56.004 --> 20:57.047
Alone?

20:59.675 --> 21:00.717
Just the two of us?

21:00.801 --> 21:02.678
- No, not really.
- Right.

21:03.178 --> 21:04.179
Want to?

21:04.263 --> 21:05.472
Stop messing around.

21:06.932 --> 21:08.475
I was being dead serious.

21:12.104 --> 21:15.107
I'm not comfortable asking other
people about their private lives.

21:15.190 --> 21:16.441
Ask him yourself.

21:16.984 --> 21:19.111
Woah, that's kinda harsh, don't you
think?

21:21.071 --> 21:23.115
Is it cause your girlfriend would get
jealous?

21:23.198 --> 21:25.284
Huh? No, I don't have a girlfriend.

21:25.367 --> 21:26.535
Are you serious?

21:26.618 --> 21:29.871
That's weird. You seem like you'd
be really popular with girls.

21:29.955 --> 21:30.956
Right, Madame Koyun?

21:31.832 --> 21:32.666
Huh? Oh

21:32.749 --> 21:34.126
CONVERSATION FROM A WHILE BACK

21:34.209 --> 21:37.462
I guess so.
You DO seem like you've dated a lot.

21:39.339 --> 21:41.008
Th-That's not even remotely true!

21:42.259 --> 21:44.803
Denying it like that just makes it more
suspicious.

21:44.886 --> 21:45.721
Huh?

21:46.388 --> 21:48.390
- Yeah, it does.
- Hey, now...

21:49.182 --> 21:50.767
No no no, wait, come on.

21:51.518 --> 21:53.437
Is that the impression you have of me?

21:59.151 --> 22:00.736
The reason he's trying so hard

22:00.819 --> 22:01.778
to deny it...

23:33.995 --> 23:36.164
GRADE 1 CLASS 1

23:39.584 --> 23:40.502
Guess what, Akine?

23:41.086 --> 23:43.296
PERKING UP

23:43.380 --> 23:44.214
I just found out Amamiya doesn't have a

23:44.297 --> 23:45.132
So why waste your time telling me?

23:45.215 --> 23:45.799
Girlfriend!

23:47.634 --> 23:49.928
Go on then... this might be your chance.

23:52.305 --> 23:53.265
I know, right?
